<ol>
<li>add a comment; something like
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="654369b8-b2d9-4ec2-9b76-b73f5d1d43ba"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[Thanks for your request.]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li>
<li>set the status to &ldquo;IN PROGRESS&rdquo;</li>
</ol>
<p>The shapes a code block takes:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>the editor's paragraph form</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[echo one

echo two]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li>
<li>text before<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[middle]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>text after</li>
<li><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[only a code block]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li>
<li>a code block, then a nested list<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[code]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<ul>
<li>nested<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[nested code]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>a status stays inline <ac:structured-macro ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">DONE</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></li>
</ul>
<p>Blocks other than a code block:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>a callout</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:rich-text-body><p>note this</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li>
<li><p>a quote, then a nested list</p><blockquote><p>quoted</p></blockquote>
<ul>
<li>nested</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><p>a table</p><table data-layout="align-start"><thead><tr><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></li>
</ul>
<p>Order and separation:</p>
<ul>
<li>a nested list before a code block<ul><li>n</li></ul><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[after the list]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li>
<li>a nested list before text<ul><li>n</li></ul>text after the list</li>
<li>a table Markdown cannot express, then a code block<table><tbody><tr><td>x</td></tr></tbody></table><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[after the table]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro></li>
<li><ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[first]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>a<br />
b</li>
<li>a<br />
b</li>
</ul>
